<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="クズリ念"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="KUZURI"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ずっと真夜中でいいのに。"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ZUTOMAYO"/><amll:meta key="album" value="虚仮の一念海馬に託す"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPPO02404478"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2639244959"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1770242097"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="532063824"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0043J7zY3E962M"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="7t79PIxAZwn6RtJzAKoKTI"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="WTP016-CN"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:26.054"><div begin="8.423" end="3:26.054"><p begin="8.423" end="13.977" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.423" end="8.967">心</span><span begin="8.967" end="9.510">臓</span><span begin="9.510" end="10.479">こじ開け</span><span begin="10.479" end="11.153">て</span> <span begin="11.253" end="11.692">さ</span><span begin="11.692" end="11.892">らっ</span><span begin="11.892" end="12.142">と</span><span begin="12.142" end="12.396">食</span><span begin="12.396" end="13.107">べ</span><span begin="13.107" end="13.977">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">撬开心脏，然后快意地吞下</span></p><p begin="14.118" end="16.225" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.118" end="14.804">何も</span><span begin="14.804" end="15.581">感じ</span><span begin="15.581" end="16.225">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可什么也没能察觉到</span></p><p begin="16.306" end="19.796" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.306" end="17.262">雨</span><span begin="17.262" end="17.498">の</span><span begin="17.498" end="18.022">中</span> <span begin="18.022" end="18.331">ずっ</span><span begin="18.331" end="18.583">と</span><span begin="18.583" end="18.990">煮込ん</span><span begin="18.990" end="19.796">でも</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">即使在雨中一直炖煮</span></p><p begin="19.916" end="22.928" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.916" end="20.279">まず</span><span begin="20.279" end="20.818">い</span><span begin="20.871" end="21.186">もの</span><span begin="21.186" end="21.834">は</span> <span begin="21.868" end="22.170">不味</span><span begin="22.170" end="22.928">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">难过的坏事终究也无法改变</span></p><p begin="23.950" end="27.485" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.950" end="24.431">世</span><span begin="24.431" end="25.045">の</span><span begin="25.045" end="26.012">中の意</span><span begin="26.012" end="26.270">図・</span><span begin="26.270" end="27.139">書が全</span><span begin="27.139" end="27.485">部</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">人世间所有的思绪和书籍</span></p><p begin="27.619" end="31.495" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.619" end="28.306">響</span><span begin="28.306" end="28.406">く</span><span begin="28.406" end="28.828">とは</span><span begin="28.828" end="29.159">限</span><span begin="29.159" end="29.259">らな</span><span begin="29.259" end="29.690">い</span><span begin="29.690" end="29.860">こ</span><span begin="29.860" end="30.165">と</span> <span begin="30.165" end="30.964">わかるよ</span><span begin="30.964" end="31.495">もう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">并非都能让人产生共鸣 这我已经了然</span></p><p begin="31.495" end="35.266" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.495" end="31.796">でも</span><span begin="31.796" end="32.159">褒</span><span begin="32.315" end="32.839">め</span><span begin="32.839" end="34.172">られるために</span><span begin="34.172" end="34.420">目</span><span begin="34.420" end="34.887">指</span><span begin="34.887" end="35.266">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如此 我也依然愿意为了被认同而前行</span></p><p begin="35.380" end="38.507" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.380" end="35.692">晴</span><span begin="35.692" end="36.667">れも</span> <span begin="36.667" end="37.356">いいんで</span><span begin="37.356" end="37.707">しょ</span><span begin="37.707" end="38.507">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">天晴了 似乎也不错 不是吗</span></p><p begin="39.247" end="41.005" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.247" end="39.525">没</span><span begin="39.525" end="39.992">頭</span><span begin="39.992" end="40.092">し</span><span begin="40.092" end="41.005">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">要认真一点诶</span></p><p begin="41.209" end="46.828" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.209" end="41.462">ちっ</span><span begin="41.462" end="41.751">ちゃい</span><span begin="41.751" end="41.935">悪</span><span begin="41.935" end="42.455">魔に</span><span begin="42.455" end="43.430">なれたら</span><span begin="43.430" end="43.960">楽</span><span begin="43.960" end="44.783">で</span><span begin="44.783" end="45.071">す</span> <span begin="45.244" end="45.830">頑張</span><span begin="45.830" end="46.828">ろ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">要是能化身为小恶魔就好了 继续加油吧</span></p><p begin="47.070" end="48.843" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.070" end="47.306">た</span><span begin="47.306" end="47.664">だ</span><span begin="47.664" end="48.134">凌</span><span begin="48.134" end="48.304">い</span><span begin="48.304" end="48.843">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还是说只是想短暂逃避而已吗</span></p><p begin="48.925" end="52.960" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.925" end="49.275">魘</span><span begin="49.275" end="49.563">され</span><span begin="49.563" end="49.689">る</span><span begin="49.689" end="50.165">のも</span><span begin="50.165" end="50.518">一</span><span begin="50.518" end="51.229">時的</span><span begin="51.229" end="51.482">な</span><span begin="51.482" end="51.662">所</span><span begin="51.662" end="51.993">業</span> <span begin="52.123" end="52.647">一過</span><span begin="52.647" end="52.960">性</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可梦魇也只是短暂的</span></p><p begin="53.042" end="55.650" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.042" end="53.387">言い</span><span begin="53.387" end="54.913">訳</span><span begin="55.053" end="55.650">です</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">终究只是个借口吗</span></p><p begin="56.198" end="59.926" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.198" end="56.691">ロンリー</span><span begin="56.691" end="57.150">ナイ</span><span begin="57.150" end="57.356">ト</span> <span begin="57.360" end="57.938">冷</span><span begin="57.938" end="58.858">蔵庫の</span><span begin="58.858" end="59.646">灯り</span><span begin="59.646" end="59.926">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">于孤独的深夜静默 冰箱里闪灼的灯光</span></p><p begin="1:00.062" end="1:03.979" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.062" end="1:00.833">映し</span><span begin="1:00.833" end="1:01.203">出す</span> <span begin="1:01.297" end="1:01.970">僕の</span><span begin="1:01.970" end="1:02.687">虚無を</span><span begin="1:02.687" end="1:03.640">証明</span><span begin="1:03.640" end="1:03.740">し</span><span begin="1:03.740" end="1:03.979">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">映照着 证明着我的虚无</span></p><p begin="1:03.903" end="1:07.771" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.903" end="1:04.512">それ</span><span begin="1:04.512" end="1:04.908">は</span> <span begin="1:05.025" end="1:05.622">誰も</span><span begin="1:05.622" end="1:06.524">奪えや</span><span begin="1:06.524" end="1:06.677">し</span><span begin="1:06.677" end="1:07.347">ないんだ</span><span begin="1:07.347" end="1:07.771">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是 谁也无法夺走的事物啊</span></p><p begin="1:07.809" end="1:12.515" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.809" end="1:08.060">孤</span><span begin="1:08.060" end="1:08.868">独</span><span begin="1:08.868" end="1:09.596">じゃなきゃ</span><span begin="1:09.596" end="1:10.355">眠れ</span><span begin="1:10.355" end="1:10.855">な</span><span begin="1:10.855" end="1:11.371">い</span> <span begin="1:11.544" end="1:12.030">眠れ</span><span begin="1:12.030" end="1:12.515">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不孤独的话 我将无法入梦 得以安睡</span></p><p begin="1:27.629" end="1:30.937" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.629" end="1:28.354">空っ</span><span begin="1:28.354" end="1:28.649">ぽ</span><span begin="1:28.649" end="1:28.870">な</span><span begin="1:28.870" end="1:29.550">オケで</span> <span begin="1:29.550" end="1:30.220">歌う</span><span begin="1:30.220" end="1:30.937">習慣</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">已经习惯了在空洞的伴奏声中歌唱</span></p><p begin="1:30.937" end="1:34.841" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.937" end="1:31.955">新参</span><span begin="1:32.130" end="1:32.991">お皿を</span> <span begin="1:32.991" end="1:33.674">舐める</span><span begin="1:33.674" end="1:34.466">探究</span><span begin="1:34.466" end="1:34.841">死因</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如同新人一般舔舐餐盘 追寻着死亡的原因</span></p><p begin="1:34.851" end="1:38.686" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.851" end="1:35.425">やり</span><span begin="1:35.425" end="1:35.917">たい</span><span begin="1:35.917" end="1:37.551">ことできなくて</span><span begin="1:37.551" end="1:38.310">正解</span><span begin="1:38.310" end="1:38.686">じゃん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不能随心所欲 也是正确的吗</span></p><p begin="1:38.763" end="1:42.491" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.763" end="1:39.294">言い</span><span begin="1:39.294" end="1:39.749">たい</span><span begin="1:39.842" end="1:40.242">こと</span><span begin="1:40.242" end="1:41.431">言えなくて</span><span begin="1:41.431" end="1:42.170">正解</span><span begin="1:42.170" end="1:42.491">じゃん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不能表明心意 也是正确的吧</span></p><p begin="1:42.634" end="1:46.324" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.634" end="1:43.180">アド</span><span begin="1:43.180" end="1:43.821">バイス</span><span begin="1:43.821" end="1:44.302">評論</span><span begin="1:44.302" end="1:45.318">人類</span> <span begin="1:45.318" end="1:45.716">脳</span><span begin="1:45.716" end="1:46.324">サンキュ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">非议与批判 真是感谢你的费心啊</span></p><p begin="1:46.476" end="1:50.571" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.476" end="1:46.993">すり</span><span begin="1:46.993" end="1:48.012">減らない</span><span begin="1:48.012" end="1:48.479">日を</span><span begin="1:48.479" end="1:48.972">選</span><span begin="1:48.972" end="1:49.368">ぼう</span><span begin="1:49.368" end="1:49.779">よ</span> <span begin="1:49.897" end="1:50.348">だっ</span><span begin="1:50.348" end="1:50.571">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">挑选一个不会使自己疲倦 消磨热情的日子吧</span></p><p begin="1:50.571" end="1:53.006" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.571" end="1:50.850">余</span><span begin="1:50.850" end="1:51.524">裕が</span><span begin="1:51.524" end="1:52.069">ない</span><span begin="1:52.069" end="1:52.571">僕</span><span begin="1:52.571" end="1:53.006">には</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我早已没有太多的时间</span></p><p begin="1:52.986" end="1:56.887" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.986" end="1:53.372">劣</span><span begin="1:53.372" end="1:53.835">等</span><span begin="1:53.835" end="1:54.217">感・</span><span begin="1:54.246" end="1:54.702">疎</span><span begin="1:54.702" end="1:55.290">外</span><span begin="1:55.290" end="1:55.644">感・</span><span begin="1:55.742" end="1:56.046">嫌</span><span begin="1:56.046" end="1:56.430">悪</span><span begin="1:56.430" end="1:56.787">感</span><span begin="1:56.787" end="1:56.887">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">浓郁的自卑 淡漠的疏离 深沉的厌恶</span></p><p begin="1:56.848" end="2:02.725" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.848" end="1:57.392">成</span><span begin="1:57.392" end="1:57.847">長</span><span begin="1:57.847" end="1:58.185">なん</span><span begin="1:58.185" end="1:58.431">て</span> <span begin="1:58.431" end="1:58.829">今</span><span begin="1:58.829" end="2:00.342">は</span><span begin="2:00.452" end="2:01.291">無理だ</span><span begin="2:01.291" end="2:02.725">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还是无法逃脱吗</span></p><p begin="2:05.832" end="2:09.560" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.832" end="2:06.325">ロンリー</span><span begin="2:06.325" end="2:06.991">ナイト</span> <span begin="2:06.999" end="2:07.530">冷</span><span begin="2:07.530" end="2:08.492">蔵庫の</span><span begin="2:08.492" end="2:09.280">灯り</span><span begin="2:09.280" end="2:09.560">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在孤独的深夜静默 冰箱里刺眼的灯光</span></p><p begin="2:09.739" end="2:13.656" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.739" end="2:10.510">映し</span><span begin="2:10.510" end="2:10.880">出す</span> <span begin="2:11.005" end="2:11.731">僕の</span><span begin="2:11.731" end="2:12.373">虚無を</span><span begin="2:12.373" end="2:13.317">証明</span><span begin="2:13.317" end="2:13.417">し</span><span begin="2:13.417" end="2:13.656">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">又一次映照着 证明着我的虚无</span></p><p begin="2:13.602" end="2:17.470" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.602" end="2:14.211">それ</span><span begin="2:14.211" end="2:14.565">は</span> <span begin="2:14.591" end="2:15.265">誰も</span><span begin="2:15.265" end="2:16.196">奪えや</span><span begin="2:16.196" end="2:16.342">し</span><span begin="2:16.342" end="2:17.013">ないんだ</span><span begin="2:17.013" end="2:17.470">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是我无法被人夺去的事物啊</span></p><p begin="2:17.462" end="2:22.168" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.462" end="2:17.713">孤</span><span begin="2:17.713" end="2:18.521">独</span><span begin="2:18.521" end="2:19.249">じゃなきゃ</span><span begin="2:19.249" end="2:20.008">眠れ</span><span begin="2:20.008" end="2:20.508">な</span><span begin="2:20.508" end="2:21.024">い</span> <span begin="2:21.197" end="2:21.683">眠れ</span><span begin="2:21.683" end="2:22.168">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我已明白 只有如此 才能安眠</span></p><p begin="2:37.286" end="2:39.057" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.286" end="2:37.662">ほっ</span><span begin="2:37.662" end="2:38.117">とい</span><span begin="2:38.117" end="2:39.057">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">已经无所谓了 随它去吧</span></p><p begin="2:39.264" end="2:44.911" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.264" end="2:39.719">解</span><span begin="2:39.719" end="2:39.837">い</span><span begin="2:39.837" end="2:39.982">た</span><span begin="2:39.982" end="2:40.311">凝り</span><span begin="2:40.311" end="2:40.452">素</span><span begin="2:40.452" end="2:41.232">早く</span><span begin="2:41.232" end="2:41.500">手</span><span begin="2:41.500" end="2:41.941">放</span><span begin="2:41.941" end="2:43.165">せ</span> <span begin="2:43.336" end="2:43.885">頑張</span><span begin="2:43.885" end="2:44.911">ろ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">快些释放积累的困倦与疲惫吧 要更努力噢</span></p><p begin="2:45.140" end="2:46.908" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.140" end="2:45.418">木</span><span begin="2:45.418" end="2:45.715">枯</span><span begin="2:45.715" end="2:46.203">らし</span><span begin="2:46.203" end="2:46.318">吹</span><span begin="2:46.318" end="2:46.908">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">凛风掠过</span></p><p begin="2:46.990" end="2:51.033" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:46.990" end="2:47.250">安</span><span begin="2:47.250" end="2:47.454">心</span><span begin="2:47.454" end="2:47.698">なん</span><span begin="2:47.698" end="2:48.056">て</span><span begin="2:48.056" end="2:48.539">一</span><span begin="2:48.539" end="2:49.259">時的</span><span begin="2:49.259" end="2:49.589">な</span><span begin="2:49.589" end="2:49.727">諸</span><span begin="2:49.727" end="2:49.999">行</span> <span begin="2:50.162" end="2:50.560">一</span><span begin="2:50.560" end="2:50.714">過</span><span begin="2:50.714" end="2:51.033">性</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">内心的平静也只是昙花一现 世事无常</span></p><p begin="2:51.108" end="2:53.685" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.108" end="2:51.563">いい</span><span begin="2:51.563" end="2:51.725">加</span><span begin="2:51.725" end="2:53.001">減</span><span begin="2:53.001" end="2:53.685">です</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也只是随心而动</span></p><p begin="2:54.270" end="2:59.257" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.270" end="2:54.788">皆</span><span begin="2:54.788" end="2:55.320">が</span> <span begin="2:55.320" end="2:55.586">いい</span><span begin="2:55.586" end="2:55.842">と</span><span begin="2:55.842" end="2:56.456">思う</span><span begin="2:56.456" end="2:57.703">曲や歌</span><span begin="2:57.703" end="2:58.046">が</span> <span begin="2:58.227" end="2:58.839">響か</span><span begin="2:58.839" end="2:59.257">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">人们所认同的歌声和乐曲都无法使我得到慰籍</span></p><p begin="2:59.348" end="3:02.001" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.348" end="2:59.899">弱</span><span begin="2:59.899" end="3:00.076">る</span><span begin="3:00.076" end="3:00.819">夜を</span><span begin="3:00.819" end="3:01.258">肯</span><span begin="3:01.258" end="3:01.669">定</span><span begin="3:01.669" end="3:01.769">し</span><span begin="3:01.769" end="3:02.001">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">反而肯定了那些让我脆弱的夜晚</span></p><p begin="3:02.012" end="3:06.199" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:02.012" end="3:02.523">その</span><span begin="3:02.523" end="3:02.914">手</span> <span begin="3:02.987" end="3:03.967">時には</span><span begin="3:03.967" end="3:04.595">借りて</span><span begin="3:04.595" end="3:04.725">み</span><span begin="3:04.725" end="3:05.440">たいけ</span><span begin="3:05.440" end="3:06.199">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有时也想借着那只手逃避</span></p><p begin="3:06.545" end="3:09.455" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.545" end="3:07.378">け</span><span begin="3:07.378" end="3:07.618">れ</span><span begin="3:07.618" end="3:08.272">ど</span> <span begin="3:08.361" end="3:08.959">いらな</span><span begin="3:08.959" end="3:09.455">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但其实并不需要</span></p><p begin="3:09.660" end="3:13.487" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:09.660" end="3:10.270">論理</span><span begin="3:10.270" end="3:10.988">無いと</span> <span begin="3:10.988" end="3:11.706">夢は</span><span begin="3:11.706" end="3:12.698">苦さを</span><span begin="3:12.698" end="3:13.097">増</span><span begin="3:13.097" end="3:13.197">し</span><span begin="3:13.197" end="3:13.487">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">缺失逻辑的幻梦 越发苦涩难咽</span></p><p begin="3:13.610" end="3:17.235" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.610" end="3:14.097">夢で</span><span begin="3:14.097" end="3:14.389">会</span><span begin="3:14.389" end="3:14.821">おう？</span><span begin="3:14.863" end="3:16.287">なんてことは</span> <span begin="3:16.287" end="3:16.734">まや</span><span begin="3:16.734" end="3:17.235">かし</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在梦境里相会吗？只是虚幻的谎言罢了</span></p><p begin="3:17.235" end="3:21.286" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.235" end="3:17.795">でも</span><span begin="3:17.795" end="3:17.985">それ</span><span begin="3:17.985" end="3:18.435">は</span> <span begin="3:18.470" end="3:19.143">僕の</span><span begin="3:19.143" end="3:19.654">生存</span><span begin="3:19.654" end="3:20.147">戦略</span><span begin="3:20.147" end="3:20.851">なんだ</span><span begin="3:20.851" end="3:21.286">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可这就是我得以生存的策略啊</span></p><p begin="3:21.348" end="3:26.054" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:21.348" end="3:21.599">孤</span><span begin="3:21.599" end="3:22.407">独</span><span begin="3:22.407" end="3:23.086">じゃなきゃ</span><span begin="3:23.086" end="3:23.770">眠れ</span><span begin="3:23.770" end="3:24.394">な</span><span begin="3:24.394" end="3:24.910">い</span> <span begin="3:25.083" end="3:25.569">眠れ</span><span begin="3:25.569" end="3:26.054">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">失去孤独的我 难以安眠</span></p></div></body></tt>